From: mscharged-port native source preparation
Subject: [PATCH] Use standard native SDK size and memory declarations
Upstream-base: 132cdee912111da6c9973b1dce13651f1979b07d
Classification: permanent modern compiler and native allocation ABI adaptation.

MWCC supplies size_t.h and mem.h; host compilers use stddef.h and string.h.
Retain original hooks/heap declarations and console includes. No HBM/audio
initialization, allocation requests or game behavior changes.

diff --git a/libs/RVL_SDK/include/revolution/axfx/AXFXHooks.h b/libs/RVL_SDK/include/revolution/axfx/AXFXHooks.h
--- a/libs/RVL_SDK/include/revolution/axfx/AXFXHooks.h
+++ b/libs/RVL_SDK/include/revolution/axfx/AXFXHooks.h
@@ -1,7 +1,11 @@
 #ifndef RVL_SDK_AXFX_HOOKS_H
 #define RVL_SDK_AXFX_HOOKS_H
 #include <revolution/types.h>
+#if defined(MSCHARGED_NATIVE)
+#include <stddef.h>
+#else
 #include <size_t.h>
+#endif
 #ifdef __cplusplus
 extern "C" {
 #endif
diff --git a/libs/RVL_SDK/include/revolution/mem/heapCommon.h b/libs/RVL_SDK/include/revolution/mem/heapCommon.h
--- a/libs/RVL_SDK/include/revolution/mem/heapCommon.h
+++ b/libs/RVL_SDK/include/revolution/mem/heapCommon.h
@@ -1,7 +1,11 @@
 #ifndef REVOLUTION_MEM_HEAP_COMMON_H
 #define REVOLUTION_MEM_HEAP_COMMON_H
 
+#if defined(MSCHARGED_NATIVE)
+#include <string.h>
+#else
 #include <mem.h>
+#endif
 #include <revolution/mem/list.h>
 #include <revolution/os/OSMutex.h>
 #include <revolution/types.h>
